{"id":2368,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2025年12月26日，机械工程学院成功举办中北大学第21届研究生科技立项答辩评审会，本次答辩邀请了我院各学科专家老师作为这次科技立项答辩评审会的评委，会议由苗鸿宾副院长主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL4-LPozT2oRfkLM4UZnNn2LmCPLRQofLlQVUN-bnNV2M4N0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyZMYhfMYh7nRA7LR6fL7W7ol7an7UinlLYLmL8UN-DUmVFMzV2U46kM4WFLmN4oRGJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/387A7DD8D07A0BD9A0DD5EC2234BB6B1/51FC7B72/29380\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 498px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL4-LPozT2oRfkLM4UZnNn2LmCPLRQofLlQVUN-bnNV2M4N0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyZMYhfMYh7nRA7LR6fL7W7ol7an7UinlLYLmL8UN-DUmVFMzV2U46kM4WFLmN4oRGJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次评审会分上、下午两场进行。上午场在机械大楼314开展，评审专家包括苗鸿宾、李忠华、董磊、赵韡、邢佳、燕超、鲁辉虎、秦慧斌等8位老师；下午场在18203和18204教室同步进行，由秦慧斌、赵韡、邢佳、燕超、苗鸿宾、李忠华、董磊、李娇娇等8位老师担任评委。评审过程中，各项目申报人依次进行汇报，围绕项目的选题意义、研究背景、研究内容、技术路线、创新性及预期成果等方面展开详细陈述。同学们准备充分、表达清晰，展现了良好的科研素养与学术潜质。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gn7lLan7n7Lzl8MM8CYUzUDL7l4Ll7oaUz9iU4LioRG8U8U0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZnkyDMSyZollbM4NbMlLiU4vaUNlbMRAVUz7ZM8-bozVFn7r7nmMRnlVFLmlsozUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F8D6589E97995C5C70BE948EA187B991/DEDF3CEA/25794\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 494px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gn7lLan7n7Lzl8MM8CYUzUDL7l4Ll7oaUz9iU4LioRG8U8U0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZnkyDMSyZollbM4NbMlLiU4vaUNlbMRAVUz7ZM8-bozVFn7r7nmMRnlVFLmlsozUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gU4ULsL4-DLl7snM7lPnz98LzQ7MRnoRLm9aLzNPM474MmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh2okhVokyDLRlYnNVkozMVMznfU8-8MRTkUmVfL8Q7M7WFLNM2U8C8U4AFLmCanmUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3F8E86052FAB93E54ACB449BB1A3FD4B/2CFCF4C8/260F4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 494px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gU4ULsL4-DLl7snM7lPnz98LzQ7MRnoRLm9aLzNPM474MmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh2okhVokyDLRlYnNVkozMVMznfU8-8MRTkUmVfL8Q7M7WFLNM2U8C8U4AFLmCanmUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\"></p><p>评审专家认真听取汇报后，从项目研究方向的前沿性与精准性、技术路线的可行性与科学性、创新点的凝练深度与实现路径等方面进行了多角度提问与点评，并就项目中存在的不足提出了具体而中肯的修改建议。这些建议不仅为项目的进一步优化指明了方向，也为同学们后续开展深入研究提供了宝贵指导。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gnNlLsnmn7Ml-4oMRlDnzlPL4vYnRnokUmvYLmvPL7-4ozU0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPMYyDnkhfLl-4n7Q7nmAkLz9PLNlanmNsLR9DUzvaUzVFU8-YU4VVL8MFLmNPolUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B176DA1B3DFDF8B1812E0F97086A70A1/CB2C1E3C/2919D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 480px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gnNlLsnmn7Ml-4oMRlDnzlPL4vYnRnokUmvYLmvPL7-4ozU0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPMYyDnkhfLl-4n7Q7nmAkLz9PLNlanmNsLR9DUzvaUzVFU8-YU4VVL8MFLmNPolUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg\"></p><p>研究生科技立项是培养学生创新意识、锻炼科研实践能力、提升科学素养的关键环节。学院将持续完善该项工作的组织与指导，从强化导师责任与激发学生潜能两方面协同推进，不断提升项目质量与研究水平，切实助力研究生培养质量的全面提高。</p><p>机械工程学院研究生会</p><p>一审一校/潘明宇</p><p>二审二校/王睿彬</p><p>三审三校/刘晨华</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gL4-LPozT2oRfkLM4UZnNn2LmCPLRQofLlQVUN-bnNV2M4N0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyZMYhfMYh7nRA7LR6fL7W7ol7an7UinlLYLmL8UN-DUmVFMzV2U46kM4WFLmN4oRGJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LPMmUsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=31647&e=.jpg"}